survey swil1j
#Data from Willie Stanton's Survey Book 1
# p. 71-74	(=PDF p.73-76)

#Typed in by Footleg, June 2013

# 21-22nd April 1957	
#Chris Hawkes	
#Paradise Regained, Mud Sump to Blue Pencil Passage			
	
centreline
cs OSGB:ST 
date 1957.04.21
# Stanton's bearings come out 3 degrees clockwise of the resurvey even after
# the magnetic declination Therion works out for the date. Measured on his
# streamway books (swildons1-c, d and e, 1952-53) against the resurvey there,
# where it is the same for all three; assumed for his other books.
calibrate compass 3    # back bearings too

#in this survey some angles are in degrees:minutes, others decimal degrees
units tape feet
units depth feet

